<title>USA: AVAX secures Nasdaq Small Cap listing.</title>
<headline>AVAX secures Nasdaq Small Cap listing.</headline>
<dateline>KANSAS CITY, Mo. 1997-03-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>AVAX Technologies Inc on Wednesday said its application for listing on the Nasdaq Small Cap Market was approved, provided the company complies with certain conditions.</p>
<p>The company specializes in the development and commercialization of novel immunotherapies, pharmaceuticals and biotechnologies for treating cancer and other life-threatening diseases.</p>
<p>((Reuters Chicago Newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
